1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,402
机器人冲刺之前，先要回答一个问题，我在哪
Before a robot can sprint, it must first answer: where am I

2
00:00:07,402 --> 00:00:10,004
看见世界，是所有动作的起点
Seeing the world is the starting point of every action

3
00:00:10,004 --> 00:00:13,888
摄像头便宜、信息量大，是机器人的主感官
Cameras are cheap and information-rich: the robot's primary sense

4
00:00:13,888 --> 00:00:19,132
但照片是平的，近处的人和远处的墙，看起来只是大小不同
But a photo is flat: a person nearby and a far wall just differ in size

5
00:00:19,132 --> 00:00:22,628
距离不会写在像素里，要靠算法算出来
Distance is not written in pixels; algorithms must compute it

6
00:00:22,628 --> 00:00:26,550
两个摄像头像人的双眼，用视差估计深度
Two cameras work like human eyes, estimating depth from disparity

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:30,884
结构光和飞行时间相机，则主动发光去量距离
Structured light and time-of-flight cameras actively emit light to measure it

8
00:00:30,884 --> 00:00:35,530
激光雷达一圈圈扫描，直接给出精确的三维点云
LiDAR scans round and round, producing precise 3D point clouds directly

9
00:00:35,530 --> 00:00:39,332
它不怕黑，但贵，也分不清颜色和纹理
It works in the dark, but it is costly and cannot read color or texture

10
00:00:39,332 --> 00:00:41,743
没有一种传感器是万能的
No single sensor can do everything

11
00:00:41,743 --> 00:00:45,560
摄像头认得出物体，激光雷达量得准距离
Cameras recognize objects; LiDAR measures distance accurately

12
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:50,180
把多种传感器对齐到同一个世界，才是真正的看见
Aligning many sensors into one world is what seeing really means

13
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:55,784
神经网络把像素变成物体，这是门，那是台阶，前面有人
Neural networks turn pixels into objects: a door, a step, a person ahead

14
00:00:55,784 --> 00:01:01,388
机器人要知道的不只是有什么，还有能不能走、能不能抓
The robot needs more than what is there: can I walk on it, can I grab it

15
00:01:01,388 --> 00:01:05,654
感知要在几十毫秒内完成，慢一拍就可能撞上
Perception must finish within tens of milliseconds; one beat late means a collision

16
00:01:05,654 --> 00:01:09,716
算力有限，看得清和算得快之间永远在取舍
Compute is limited: seeing clearly and computing fast is a constant trade-off

17
00:01:09,716 --> 00:01:13,781
强光、黑夜、遮挡、反光，都会让传感器失灵
Glare, darkness, occlusion, and reflections can all blind a sensor

18
00:01:13,781 --> 00:01:18,620
好的系统不是从不出错，而是知道自己什么时候不可靠
A good system never assumes it is right; it knows when it is unreliable

19
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,957
所以看见不是一台相机的事
So seeing is not the job of a single camera

20
00:01:20,957 --> 00:01:24,732
是传感器、算法、算力和安全策略的系统工程
It is system engineering across sensors, algorithms, compute, and safety

21
00:01:24,732 --> 00:01:27,788
感知越可靠，机器人的动作才敢越快
The more reliable the perception, the faster the robot dares to move
